卻有國王般的享受。\n最後，雖然這間店有五星送沙拉的活動，但是認識我的朋友就會知道：我不會被沙拉收買，以上評論絕對屬實，我跟我被免費咖哩飯填滿的胃一同保證。\n以上，我是Sam，一位追求與食物真正貼近距離的美食家。",null,[0,185]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/468689860204350965/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVaZVZwSE9ESlhiR3hFWVZaU1IxSldVbEJhYTNoUVZEQmpNRTFyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/468689860204350965/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVaZVZwSE9ESlhiR3hFWVZaU1IxSldVbEJhYTNoUVZEQmpNRTFyUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/468689860204350965/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVaZVZwSE9ESlhiR3hFWVZaU1IxSldVbEJhYTNoUVZEQmpNRTFyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/468689860204350965/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVaZVZwSE9ESlhiR3hFWVZaU1IxSldVbEJhYTNoUVZEQmpNRTFyUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/468689860204350965/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVaZVZwSE9ESlhiR3hFWVZaU1IxSldVbEJhYTNoUVZEQmpNRTFyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/468689860204350965/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVaZVZwSE9ESlhiR3hFWVZaU1IxSldVbEJhYTNoUVZEQmpNRTFyUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,459,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25ZeVpHODJXbGxEYVZSR1JWUlBaa3hQVDBjME1rRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xad3fa93d1ef786dc!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnYyZG82WllDaVRGRVRPZkxPT0c0MkE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25ZeVpHODJXbGxEYVZSR1JWUlBaa3hQVDBjME1rRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25ZeVpHODJXbGxEYVZSR1JWUlBaa3hQVDBjME1rRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25ZeVpHODJXbGxEYVZSR1JWUlBaa3hQVDBjME1rRRILMGUtNFNYQUVtWnoaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09uWXlaRzgyV2xsRGFWUkdSVlJQWmt4UFQwYzBNa0USCzBlLTRTWEFFbVp6IhIJAAAAAAAAAAAR3Ib3Hj2pP60qCzBlLTRTWEFFbVp6\u00